abstract: >-
  An interactive, hand-coded dashboard comparing U.S. maternal health
  outcomes with high-income peer nations: maternal mortality and the racial
  gap within the U.S., timing of pregnancy-related deaths, paid maternity
  leave policy, and the maternity care workforce.
